eautiful girls she’s ever wanted?!\n\nA story about a girl and her overwhelming love for beautiful girls—\"Now, let's begin!\"\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Video Games","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Software Development","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":90,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Drawing","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anachronism","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":57,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":45,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":40,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"16bit Sensation: Another Layer","english":"16bit Sensation: Another Layer","native":"16bitセンセーション ANOTHER LAYER","romaji":"16bit Sensation: ANOTHER LAYER","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"16bit的感动 ANOTHER LAYER"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"16位元的輝煌 Another Layer"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"16位的辉煌 Another Layer"}]},"trailer":{"id":"2SshK7Ed2g8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2SshK7Ed2g8/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}